    {
      "cue_id": "bark.reputation.harju_kings_trusted.cheer",
      "content_id": "bark.reputation.harju_kings_trusted",
      "entry_id": "cheer",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/bark.reputation.harju_kings_trusted.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.entries[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.merchant_stall",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "A few yard workers glance up and nod - word of the Harju Kings' friends travels faster than patrol boots.",
      "text_sha256": "ce15f9bd8fd3c8c21e9fe9c2865173722acc2b530a6b6a7bd0bbde969497137a",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.merchant_stall/bark_reputation_harju_kings_trusted_cheer.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_confiscated.brewery_boarded",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_confiscated",
      "entry_id": "brewery_boarded",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_confiscated.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Planks seal the yard and the watch seal is fresh. Aita is gone into Kaja's shadows, and the vats stand empty.",
      "text_sha256": "b714e2f05348f930b85326c9a2dd4f281839c6550ddaeea0d242018ee147c409",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_brewery_confiscated_brewery_boarded.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_exonerated.brewery_open",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_exonerated",
      "entry_id": "brewery_open",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_exonerated.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The reinforced bands held. Aita's vats are still hers, steam rising, and the ward can draw honest ale again.",
      "text_sha256": "166e160ff22e2e172cfd0d60041f10dc44bd2f45257730486c7198dad3d7fcc5",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_brewery_exonerated_brewery_open.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_monopolized.brewery_contract",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_monopolized",
      "entry_id": "brewery_contract",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.brewery_monopolized.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Jürgen's contract banner hangs over the yard. The ale still flows, but every barrel leaves under his tally and Aita tends his vats.",
      "text_sha256": "cec0516823e081b7d3ee0d3820c88569db1305e9d26d98687d71690c401d4d92",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_brewery_monopolized_brewery_contract.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_brewery.inspect_brewery",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_brewery",
      "entry_id": "inspect_brewery",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_brewery.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Aita's ale is fine. The trouble is the water she draws - the same tainted municipal line.",
      "text_sha256": "bea60120054faeb56a4db6d8d39d3d408ef565bbd59401f66851c1adc45bbd61",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_inspect_brewery_inspect_brewery.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_checkpoint.inspect_checkpoint",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_checkpoint",
      "entry_id": "inspect_checkpoint",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_checkpoint.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Henning's cistern is cracked and choked with runoff. Neglect, or someone wanted it that way.",
      "text_sha256": "270ec899fb2edd306ba651ac4c30e012b93584f61ec2951cb5b82d31ac962dfc",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_inspect_checkpoint_inspect_checkpoint.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_cistern.inspect_well",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_cistern",
      "entry_id": "inspect_well",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_cistern.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The well water smells wrong - runoff and silt, not the clean draw Aita needs.",
      "text_sha256": "f84dfcff90541b153438c9991e1695c580399daf69e5c24e5ba4404bcaa9a0cd",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_inspect_cistern_inspect_well.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_supply.inspect_supply",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_supply",
      "entry_id": "inspect_supply",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.inspect_supply.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "These barrels came off the same spoiled grain wagons the merchants are quietly dumping.",
      "text_sha256": "04ce9927933d80a30324f781edfbc997e42fafcd00dd4052e234a58d93da6848",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_bitter_brew_inspect_supply_inspect_supply.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_escaped.mart_emboldened",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_escaped",
      "entry_id": "mart_emboldened",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_escaped.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The watch boarded her yard and she still walked free. If steel can do that, imagine what we do with a whole street behind us.",
      "text_sha256": "5248f6969a3d5dc325ecd84bdc0a9074352a85417d23ce00494eeb14292e847a",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_bitter_brew_mart_escaped_mart_emboldened.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_exonerated.mart_respects",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_exonerated",
      "entry_id": "mart_respects",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_exonerated.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "You held the line for Aita when the watch wanted a scapegoat. That is the smith I would follow through a gate.",
      "text_sha256": "d13ba725bbe3dd5869ef405e0dceec7fa6b305c647c00ba51f057637782aab43",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_bitter_brew_mart_exonerated_mart_respects.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_monopolized.mart_disgusted",
      "content_id": "dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_monopolized",
      "entry_id": "mart_disgusted",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.bitter_brew.mart_monopolized.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Jürgen's banner hangs on her vats and you signed the paperwork that let it happen. I thought your hammer stood for people, not merchants.",
      "text_sha256": "ca39cf233770f7daf958074ccc443d73dae977987b264976caf613081eb2b5c6",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_bitter_brew_mart_monopolized_mart_disgusted.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat.cat_answer",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat",
      "entry_id": "cat_answer",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_cat.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.forge_cat",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The cat stretches, flicks its tail once, and settles back into the warm stone as if the forge belongs to it.",
      "text_sha256": "7345e35f50c8154be140770cd5df8adeaac46ff2ec693fb61ebbfcda7ba93b2e",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.forge_cat/dialogue_demo_forge_cat_cat_answer.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat.kalev_closes",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat",
      "entry_id": "kalev_closes",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_cat.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[2]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Fair enough. Stay out from under the hammer.",
      "text_sha256": "d5227954d0edbba010175b4d02871ec5560443bf376783221a57e60e10abced1",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_demo_forge_cat_kalev_closes.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat.kalev_greets",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_cat",
      "entry_id": "kalev_greets",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_cat.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Still hunting mice, or just warming yourself by the coals again?",
      "text_sha256": "ed4beee2c80596ce9bab09099b6c983926236ea3714c804fb7d19fe7870498cf",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_demo_forge_cat_kalev_greets.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning.henning_closes",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning",
      "entry_id": "henning_closes",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_henning.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[2]",
      "speaker_id": "char.henning",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "See that both stay true. I will be back before the street lamps are lit.",
      "text_sha256": "e21a487b7eab7057c4680f7066a101a7b65594d88a554b576a291b58ee6a6005",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.henning/dialogue_demo_forge_henning_henning_closes.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning.henning_opens",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning",
      "entry_id": "henning_opens",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_henning.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.henning",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Still at the anvil, smith? Good. The Watch likes a man who keeps his hands busy and his ledger honest.",
      "text_sha256": "6b5ffa338054fa9930c8decc16374d7d3273de4de284d97e522869b11740c389",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.henning/dialogue_demo_forge_henning_henning_opens.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning.kalev_responds",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.forge_henning",
      "entry_id": "kalev_responds",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.forge_henning.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Busy hands keep the quarter fed. Honest ledgers keep me out of your cells.",
      "text_sha256": "2af099750cf0cf3c844b6663b47e2d665067de651efe165f9bb367d5e2fbe617",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_demo_forge_henning_kalev_responds.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street.kalev_closes",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street",
      "entry_id": "kalev_closes",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.mart_street.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[3]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Then prove you can hold a line of iron before you talk about holding a line at the gate.",
      "text_sha256": "38bae3d6cba1f800570f06eb4fec925014ca8ddf7fee6f10a81fe53241bd1cfd",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_demo_mart_street_kalev_closes.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street.kalev_responds",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street",
      "entry_id": "kalev_responds",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.mart_street.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The street is awake because people still have work to finish. Put your heat in the forge, not in slogans.",
      "text_sha256": "9ab1dd40ea3c2ba2cebf1643c68cdd5fa92d53f42a2a38d97746ceb8e2205eb5",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_demo_mart_street_kalev_responds.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street.mart_opens",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street",
      "entry_id": "mart_opens",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.mart_street.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Master, the street is awake tonight. If the Black Cloaks move now, we will not get another chance.",
      "text_sha256": "b11da7cb2614d9b5bf48de17527d3a28913f08685bb43ac9638f66bad6ae163d",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_demo_mart_street_mart_opens.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street.mart_pushes",
      "content_id": "dialogue.demo.mart_street",
      "entry_id": "mart_pushes",
      "source": "content/demo/dialogue.demo.mart_street.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[2]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The forge will not free anyone if we keep tempering fear instead of steel.",
      "text_sha256": "2fc47a7786b0b5cb832e650965087091221718feef4d20346bc323158f1a44f6",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_demo_mart_street_mart_pushes.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery.open_chest",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery",
      "entry_id": "open_chest",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Mart's bed is cold and the rejected blanks are gone from the chest.",
      "text_sha256": "1e723b372385da97cf1c2205c2591cccd667fc8195a10691c1e471a53a660b9f",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_chest_discovery_open_chest.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery.realize_absence",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery",
      "entry_id": "realize_absence",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.chest_discovery.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "He must have passed the marked rejects to the Black Cloaks before vanishing.",
      "text_sha256": "8f184c72ef25ec92f3765c8e9a26b3aa9aefd0c466d9d7a3c91d8e34155f06cc",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_chest_discovery_realize_absence.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.henning_arrival.henning_pressure",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.henning_arrival",
      "entry_id": "henning_pressure",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark_henning.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.henning",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Then your ledger will explain it before my next inspection.",
      "text_sha256": "0dffaa41327f9b648413db1c9e84b4e58aac8ee392749b719bf92d93bc32dbc1",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.henning/dialogue_makers_mark_henning_arrival_henning_pressure.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.henning_arrival.henning_shows_spearhead",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.henning_arrival",
      "entry_id": "henning_shows_spearhead",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark_henning.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.henning",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Your mark is on this spearhead, smith. Tell me why rejected iron is turning up in rebel hands.",
      "text_sha256": "701d4be57bdc87ec3126599188698bea55eb026196b3769f545d5f18d43a5017",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.henning/dialogue_makers_mark_henning_arrival_henning_shows_spearhead.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.alter_close",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice",
      "entry_id": "alter_close",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[2]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "A falsified line buys Mart time, if no one compares the pages.",
      "text_sha256": "3ede3c54c0cd4e42bb8b65476eb466f1e209c1acd6f9932077d592b483963578",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_ledger_choice_alter_close.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.destroy_close",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice",
      "entry_id": "destroy_close",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[3]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Ash hides the rejects tonight. The Watch will notice the gap.",
      "text_sha256": "2b23916360a9fbe7af02e8b47811855acb240ae5c9f2b1c43579682d4ae18721",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_ledger_choice_destroy_close.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.ledger_review",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice",
      "entry_id": "ledger_review",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "The ledger still names every rejected blank Mart logged. What do I leave behind?",
      "text_sha256": "f461e1dece701b45d725ed8507daf734e7e9dd1d385f63c2a24f950ad8133e31",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_ledger_choice_ledger_review.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.preserve_close",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice",
      "entry_id": "preserve_close",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.ledger_choice.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Henning can read the truth later, but the record stays honest.",
      "text_sha256": "90a09381052fbe488b77323bd79f2049e10415884d26e46f34c2709ee1992956",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_ledger_choice_preserve_close.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up.dream_recount",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up",
      "entry_id": "dream_recount",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "It was as if I was in the future - roads made of metal, men flying in metal birds, and we were ruling the Germans and the Russians. Can you imagine? Us! Ruling over them. Ha.",
      "text_sha256": "ebdaa94fdd9f5125a0f63a897a19525fced56471b1f973d68b906403d9c077fd",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_wake_up_dream_recount.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up.waking_groan",
      "content_id": "dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up",
      "entry_id": "waking_groan",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.makers_mark.wake_up.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Ugh... what a dream. What a... mad dream.",
      "text_sha256": "95839d25c765250f2c99da5f848d4caae131304cbd1feea7dd40729862e51d85",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_makers_mark_wake_up_waking_groan.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.test_overflow.long_followup",
      "content_id": "dialogue.test_overflow",
      "entry_id": "long_followup",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.test_overflow.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.kalev",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Then we will move carefully, because one wrong word in the street can turn a commission into a confession.",
      "text_sha256": "a424ec2e0564ed4df3de9af2edc0f5e843747375b013cf3e05969ef2e46fd791",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.kalev/dialogue_test_overflow_long_followup.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.test_overflow.long_opening",
      "content_id": "dialogue.test_overflow",
      "entry_id": "long_opening",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.test_overflow.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Kalev, the Lower Town hears every rumor twice before dawn, and tonight the well, the brewery yard, and the watch checkpoint all carry the same bitter story about spoiled grain, missing ledger pages, and a forged maker mark that should never have left your smithy.",
      "text_sha256": "3ca7effced069b8e280a347713addecd2136fda4251cac7cf9fc3eb478d4e519",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_test_overflow_long_opening.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.test_runner.followup.trusted_once",
      "content_id": "dialogue.test_runner.followup",
      "entry_id": "trusted_once",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.test_runner.followup.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[1]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "This warning only lands once.",
      "text_sha256": "0e56a6021ea4814aa56fa88a02a3cfeeaf34f5307d0550d53f78e13e2c0ba207",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_test_runner_followup_trusted_once.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.test_runner.followup.trusted_reunion",
      "content_id": "dialogue.test_runner.followup",
      "entry_id": "trusted_reunion",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.test_runner.followup.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[0]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "You came back. I kept the name you asked about.",
      "text_sha256": "a8e5c018cc28cf7d8d6bfcdb88ed03242c95f0d857cdc8d29dc3c3f1a33ca1ed",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
      "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "voice_id": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "audio_path": "audio/voice/en/char.mart/dialogue_test_runner_followup_trusted_reunion.mp3"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "dialogue.test_runner.intro.mart_doubted",
      "content_id": "dialogue.test_runner.intro",
      "entry_id": "mart_doubted",
      "source": "content/examples/valid/dialogue.test_runner.intro.json",
      "source_pointer": "$.nodes[2]",
      "speaker_id": "char.mart",
      "locale": "en",
      "text_key": "",
      "text": "Fine. Waste the night if you want.",
      "text_sha256": "9a7940d57d77589f46ee46cfdc385fdc4c1fbeefc5750b35a299877fed9ff043",
      "provider": "elevenlabs",
